## Subgraph Indexing

The Graph configuration in `subgraph/`:
- `schema.graphql` - Entity definitions
- `subgraph.yaml` - Data source configuration
- `src/mapping.ts` - Event handlers (AssemblyScript)

Indexed entities:
- SBT (Soulbound Token)
- Community
- CommunityMembership
- Activity
- ReputationScore
- WeeklyActivityStat
- GlobalStat

